Every option is part of the resolution cache's key unless it is listed, with the reason it cannot change a resolution result, in `ModuleResolutionKey.IgnoredOptions`. A unit test toggles every option of every command and checks that the key changes exactly for the options not listed, and a command-line test checks that each listed option it can toggle reuses every module and resolves the same afresh, while options in the key, from the command line, a project file, `--boogie`, hidden and `--legacy-*` options, reuse none.
